        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2013 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Binge eating, bulimia nervosa, binge eating disorder, anorexia-bulimia are terms often used without really knowing what precisely one is referring to. Otherwise, there are many articles concerning anorexia nervosa in medical literature, a disease, which can be seen and fascinates. These eating disorders are frequent in today's society; medical, psychological and social consequences are important."
